[CustomMessages]
english.ProductName=AstMatrix for %1
chinesesimplified.ProductName=AstMatrix（%1 版）
english.UninstallShortcut=Uninstall AstMatrix for %1
chinesesimplified.UninstallShortcut=卸载 AstMatrix for %1
english.OtherUninstallShortcut=卸载 AstMatrix for %1
chinesesimplified.OtherUninstallShortcut=Uninstall AstMatrix for %1
english.PluginUninstallShortcut=Uninstall AstMatrix.lnk
chinesesimplified.PluginUninstallShortcut=卸载 AstMatrix.lnk
english.WelcomeIllustrator=Install AstMatrix for Illustrator.%n%nSupports Illustrator 27.x–30.x. Close Illustrator before continuing.
chinesesimplified.WelcomeIllustrator=安装 AstMatrix（Illustrator 版）。%n%n支持 Illustrator 27.x 至 30.x。继续前请关闭 Illustrator。
english.WelcomePhotoshop=Install AstMatrix for Photoshop.%n%nRequires Photoshop 26.0 or later. Close Photoshop before continuing.
chinesesimplified.WelcomePhotoshop=安装 AstMatrix（Photoshop 版）。%n%n需要 Photoshop 26.0 或更高版本。继续前请关闭 Photoshop。
english.UpdateTitle=Update AstMatrix for %1
chinesesimplified.UpdateTitle=更新 AstMatrix（%1 版）
english.UpdateIntro=%1 → %2%n%nClick Install to update AstMatrix.
chinesesimplified.UpdateIntro=%1 → %2%n%n点击“安装”更新 AstMatrix。
english.RegistrationIncomplete=Unable to update the existing installation. Uninstall AstMatrix and try again.
chinesesimplified.RegistrationIncomplete=无法更新现有安装。请先卸载 AstMatrix 后重试。
english.StateMissing=Unable to update the existing installation. Uninstall AstMatrix and try again.
chinesesimplified.StateMissing=无法更新现有安装。请先卸载 AstMatrix 后重试。
english.ManagerDirectoryMismatch=Run the installer again without changing the installation location.
chinesesimplified.ManagerDirectoryMismatch=请重新运行安装程序，并保留原安装位置。
english.PreflightFailed=Unable to prepare installation. Close {#HostName} and try again.
chinesesimplified.PreflightFailed=暂时无法安装。请关闭 {#HostName} 后重试。
english.ReviewLog=If the problem persists, send this log file to support: %1
chinesesimplified.ReviewLog=如问题持续，请向支持人员提供此日志：%1
english.HostNotDetected={#HostName} was not found. You will need a supported version to use AstMatrix. Continue?
chinesesimplified.HostNotDetected=未找到 {#HostName}。使用 AstMatrix 需要安装兼容版本。是否继续？
english.InstallationCancelled=Installation cancelled.
chinesesimplified.InstallationCancelled=已取消安装。
english.InstallFailed=Plugin installation failed.
chinesesimplified.InstallFailed=插件安装失败。
english.ShortcutFailed=Unable to add the uninstall shortcut. Reinstall AstMatrix and try again.
chinesesimplified.ShortcutFailed=无法添加卸载快捷方式。请重新安装 AstMatrix。
english.ExtractionFinished=Restart Photoshop and check that AstMatrix appears in the Plugins menu. If it is missing, try installing again.
chinesesimplified.ExtractionFinished=请重启 Photoshop，检查“插件”菜单中是否出现 AstMatrix。若未出现，请重新安装。
english.UninstallOptionsTitle=AstMatrix for %1 - Uninstall options
chinesesimplified.UninstallOptionsTitle=AstMatrix（%1 版）- 卸载选项
english.UninstallOptionsIntro=Uninstall AstMatrix. Disabling developer mode may prevent other extensions from working.
chinesesimplified.UninstallOptionsIntro=将卸载 AstMatrix。关闭开发者模式可能影响其他扩展。
english.DisableCepDeveloperMode=Disable CEP developer mode
chinesesimplified.DisableCepDeveloperMode=关闭 CEP 开发者模式
english.ContinueUninstall=Continue uninstall
chinesesimplified.ContinueUninstall=继续卸载
english.Cancel=Cancel
chinesesimplified.Cancel=取消
english.UninstallFailed=Unable to uninstall AstMatrix. Close {#HostName} and try again.
chinesesimplified.UninstallFailed=未能卸载 AstMatrix。请关闭 {#HostName} 后重试。

; Controller errors use stable keys; the full technical detail stays in installer.log.
english.ErrRegistrationConflict=Unable to update the existing installation. Uninstall AstMatrix and try again.
chinesesimplified.ErrRegistrationConflict=无法更新现有安装。请先卸载 AstMatrix 后重试。
english.ErrUnregisteredState=An existing AstMatrix installation was found. Remove it before continuing.
chinesesimplified.ErrUnregisteredState=检测到已有 AstMatrix。请先移除旧版后继续。
english.ErrShortcutState=Unable to add the uninstall shortcut. Reinstall AstMatrix and try again.
chinesesimplified.ErrShortcutState=无法添加卸载快捷方式。请重新安装 AstMatrix。
english.ErrUninstallerMissing=The uninstaller is missing. Reinstall AstMatrix and try again.
chinesesimplified.ErrUninstallerMissing=卸载程序缺失。请重新安装 AstMatrix 后重试。
english.ErrShortcutConflict=Unable to update the uninstall shortcut. Rename or remove the existing shortcut and try again.
chinesesimplified.ErrShortcutConflict=无法更新卸载快捷方式。请重命名或移除已有快捷方式后重试。
english.ErrShortcutName=Unable to create the uninstall shortcut. Try installing AstMatrix again.
chinesesimplified.ErrShortcutName=无法创建卸载快捷方式。请重新安装 AstMatrix。
english.ErrHostRunning=Close {#HostName} completely, then try again.
chinesesimplified.ErrHostRunning=请完全关闭 {#HostName} 后重试。
english.ErrHostIncompatible=Install a supported version of {#HostName} before continuing.
chinesesimplified.ErrHostIncompatible=请先安装兼容版本的 {#HostName}。
english.ErrUnsafePath=Unable to access the installation files. Check the installation location and try again.
chinesesimplified.ErrUnsafePath=无法访问安装文件。请检查安装位置后重试。
english.ErrInvalidState=Unable to use the existing installation. Remove the old AstMatrix installation and try again.
chinesesimplified.ErrInvalidState=无法使用现有安装。请先移除旧版 AstMatrix 后重试。
english.ErrPayloadConflict=Unable to update the existing plugin. Remove the old AstMatrix installation and try again.
chinesesimplified.ErrPayloadConflict=无法更新已有插件。请先移除旧版 AstMatrix 后重试。
english.ErrPayloadHash=The installer may be damaged. Download it again.
chinesesimplified.ErrPayloadHash=安装文件可能已损坏，请重新下载。
english.ErrRollbackNeeded=The previous installation did not finish. Contact support before trying again.
chinesesimplified.ErrRollbackNeeded=上次安装未完成，请联系支持人员处理。
english.ErrUpiaRunning=An Adobe installer is running. Wait for it to finish and try again.
chinesesimplified.ErrUpiaRunning=Adobe 安装程序正在运行。请等待完成后重试。
english.ErrNewerPlugin=A newer version of AstMatrix is already installed.
chinesesimplified.ErrNewerPlugin=已安装更新版本的 AstMatrix。
english.ErrUpiaVerify=Unable to confirm the installation. Restart Photoshop and check whether AstMatrix is available.
chinesesimplified.ErrUpiaVerify=无法确认安装结果。请重启 Photoshop 检查 AstMatrix 是否可用。
english.ErrUpiaStopped=Installation did not finish. Try again.
chinesesimplified.ErrUpiaStopped=安装未完成，请重试。
english.ErrManagedConflict=AstMatrix is already installed. Remove it through Creative Cloud, then try again.
chinesesimplified.ErrManagedConflict=已安装 AstMatrix。请通过 Creative Cloud 移除后重试。
english.ErrManagedIdentity=Please uninstall AstMatrix through Creative Cloud.
chinesesimplified.ErrManagedIdentity=请通过 Creative Cloud 卸载 AstMatrix。
english.ErrUpiaMissing=Repair Creative Cloud, then try again.
chinesesimplified.ErrUpiaMissing=请修复 Creative Cloud 后重试。
english.ErrUpiaAmbiguous=Please uninstall AstMatrix for Photoshop through Creative Cloud.
chinesesimplified.ErrUpiaAmbiguous=请通过 Creative Cloud 卸载 Photoshop 版 AstMatrix。
english.ErrUpiaRemoval=Unable to uninstall AstMatrix. Try again or remove it through Creative Cloud.
chinesesimplified.ErrUpiaRemoval=无法卸载 AstMatrix。请重试，或通过 Creative Cloud 卸载。
english.ErrUpiaRemovalVerify=Unable to confirm the uninstall. Check AstMatrix in Creative Cloud.
chinesesimplified.ErrUpiaRemovalVerify=无法确认卸载结果。请在 Creative Cloud 中检查 AstMatrix。
english.ErrInstallerBusy=Another AstMatrix installer is running. Wait for it to finish before retrying.
chinesesimplified.ErrInstallerBusy=另一个 AstMatrix 安装程序正在运行。请等待其完成后重试。
english.ErrInvalidOption=Disabling CEP developer mode is only supported when uninstalling the Illustrator edition.
chinesesimplified.ErrInvalidOption=仅在卸载 Illustrator 版时可以关闭 CEP 开发者模式。
english.ErrDowngrade=A newer version of AstMatrix is already installed.
chinesesimplified.ErrDowngrade=已安装更新版本的 AstMatrix。
